    "documentation" : " Maximum number of encoded websocket bytes that may be in-flight per client before senders apply backpressure.\n Defaults to {@code FLUXZERO_MAX_IN_FLIGHT_WEBSOCKET_BYTES}, or 16 MiB when unset.\n",
    "constantValue" : null
  }, {
